Why not use only an LLM?
An LLM alone may not have access to current transaction data, updated internal policies, or customer-specific information.
- RAG helps provide relevant information from documents.
- APIs provide current data from authorized systems.
- The LLM helps interpret the question and formulate a natural-language answer.
